# AT-HEIGHT (input cluster U1): the @ picker's height and scroll over thirty
# names every ranking ties on (items/f-01.txt .. items/f-30.txt, one length,
# so fx v0.0.16 and xfx both list them in byte order). a5fe00d7 (up to 10
# rows while five transcript rows stay visible), 99e62b8e (scroll by the rows
# the last frame painted). At 40 rows the list is 10 rows, at 18 it is 8, at
# 16 and below 6 (filePickerReservedRows, picker_presentation.zig:661-666).
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
work p5-input-at-height-ws
wait 4
type @f-
wait 1.5
snap at
key Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
wait 0.6
snap down12
key Up Up Up Up Up Up
wait 0.6
snap up6
key Up Up Up
wait 0.6
snap up9
key PPage
wait 0.6
snap pgup
